«

«  @ Program RhoijRdm to generate the random correlation matrix 'ρij' which is to be called after random seed initialisation
	«
		-1. 1. Random
	»
	→ RhoToss
	«
		'Nbvar' Recall Duplicate
		{ } + + 0. Con 'Nbvar'
		Recall 2
		for i
			i 1 - 1
			for j
				{ } i + j + RhoToss
				Put -1
			step
			-1
		step
		Duplicate 'ρij' Store
	»
» 'RhoijRdm' Sto



